#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/037/SubCts502_03759:TEXT_SUBCTS502_03759_SYSTEM_000_005:1"
msgid "To replay old quests with New Game+, open the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>New Game+</ui-edge-color></ui-color> interface located under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Duty</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu, and select the chapter you wish to experience anew."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なお、「つよくてニューゲーム」中は、<br>特別なルールが適用されます。<br>詳しくは、メニュー内のヘルプを確認してください。
#. de: Für Neues Spiel+ gelten bestimmte Regeln und Bedingungen. Die Einzelheiten findest du im Hilfetext im Fenster „Neues Spiel+“.
#. fr: Notez que ce mode de jeu utilise des règles spéciales. Vous pouvez les consulter à partir du menu d'aide de la fenêtre “Nouvelle partie +”.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/037/SubCts502_03759:TEXT_SUBCTS502_03759_SYSTEM_000_006:1"
msgid "Please note that special rules and conditions will apply when replaying quests with New Game+. For detailed information, please review the help text in the New Game+ menu."
msgstr ""
